"                        ╭ Abandon a starting run? ─────────────────────────────────────────────╮                        "
"                        │                                                                      │                        "
"                        │  Quitting waits until the job of a new run has started, which can    │                        "
"                        │  take minutes. Abandon it instead? If its pod is still being         │                        "
"                        │  prepared, it is deleted and the run fails, as Ctrl-C does on the    │                        "
"                        │  command line; once its job is being sent, the run is detached       │                        "
"                        │  instead.                                                            │                        "
"                        │                                                                      │                        "
"                        │                                                y abandon    n wait   │                        "
"                        │                                                                      │                        "
"                        ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯                        "
